        "headline": "受颱風白海豚影響星宇航空8月8日往返沖繩航班全數取消",
        "summary": "受颱風白海豚持續影響沖繩地區，星宇航空於2026年8月8日宣布，當天台灣往返沖繩的所有航班全數取消，包含原訂安排的加班機JX1870與JX1871。根據中央氣象署8日上午8時觀測，颱風白海豚中心位於台北東北東方約510公里處，航空公司提醒旅客搭機前關注最新航班資訊。",
        "headline_en": "STARLUX Cancels All Okinawa Flights Aug 8 Due to Typhoon Dolphin",
        "summary_en": "STARLUX Airlines announced on August 8, 2026, that all flights between Taiwan and Okinawa scheduled for the day have been canceled due to the ongoing impact of Typhoon Dolphin. The cancellations include extra flights JX1870 and JX1871, which were previously scheduled to help transport affected passengers. According to Taiwan's Central Weather Administration, Typhoon Dolphin was positioned approximately 510 kilometers east-northeast of Taipei as of 8:00 a.m. on August 8. The airline has urged passengers to check the official website for updated flight information prior to departure.",
